109
00:05:53,120 --> 00:05:57,120
 All that progress culminates in the Uniswap continuous clearing auction.

110
00:05:57,120 --> 00:06:00,640
 No sniping, no timing games, no whale advantages,

111
00:06:00,640 --> 00:06:03,680
 just fair, transparent on-chain price discovery.

112
00:06:03,680 --> 00:06:04,640
 Here's how it works.

113
00:06:04,640 --> 00:06:06,800
 A project set to side an allotment of tokens.

114
00:06:06,800 --> 00:06:09,440
 The continuous clearing auction sells them continuously,

115
00:06:09,440 --> 00:06:12,640
 block by block, over a customizable window, typically a few days.

116
00:06:12,640 --> 00:06:14,640
 Supply is fixed across the auction,

117
00:06:14,640 --> 00:06:17,840
 and as demand comes in, the clearing price adjusts.

118
00:06:17,840 --> 00:06:19,920
 If new bids arrive, the price moves up.

119
00:06:19,920 --> 00:06:21,520
 If they don't, it holds steady.

120
00:06:21,520 --> 00:06:24,240
 Since bids are filled gradually over the entire window,

121
00:06:24,240 --> 00:06:27,280
 early participants often end up with a lower average price,

122
00:06:27,280 --> 00:06:29,120
 while still giving everyone time to place orders.

123
00:06:29,120 --> 00:06:32,720
 When the auction ends, the proceeds concede a Uniswap V4 pool,

124
00:06:32,720 --> 00:06:36,560
 giving you day one liquidity without exchange fees or market maker contracts.

125
00:06:36,560 --> 00:06:40,160
