128
00:06:44,320 --> 00:06:48,320
 bootstrapping and auctioning of existing low liquidity assets as well.

129
00:06:48,320 --> 00:06:50,480
 If you're launching a token and want an on-chain,

130
00:06:50,480 --> 00:06:53,760
 transparent sale that gets tokens into the hands of real believers,

131
00:06:53,760 --> 00:06:56,480
 the Uniswap continuous clearing auction is the way to do it.

